<title>UK: SOCCER-SCOTTISH F.A. CUP FOURTH ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTTISH F.A. CUP FOURTH ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Scottish F.A. Cup</p>
<p>fourth round match on Monday:</p>
<p> Hibernian	  1  Celtic	   1</p>
<p>Played on Sunday:</p>
<p> Hearts	     1  Dundee United  1</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Brechin	    1  Raith	    2</p>
<p> Clyde		0  Kilmarnock     1</p>
<p> Falkirk	    2  Dunfermline    1</p>
<p> Greenock Morton  2  Dundee	   2</p>
<p> Motherwell	 1  Hamilton	 1</p>
<p> Rangers	    3  East Fife	0</p>
<p>Revised quarter-final draw:</p>
<p> Hibernian or Celtic	 v Rangers</p>
<p> Falkirk			 v Raith</p>
<p> Hearts or Dundee United   v Motherwell or Hamilton</p>
<p>Greenock Morton or Dundee v Kilmarnock</p>
<p>Matches to be played on March 8 or 9.</p>
</text>
